# The published site needs only the game and its web-sized art. Everything
# below stays on this machine — the repo is public, so anything committed here
# is readable by anyone who finds it.

# Full-resolution masters. The game uses assets/cards/web/*.jpg; there is no
# reason to put 1024px photographs of the children on a public URL.
assets/cards/*.png
assets/characters/
assets/brand/heart-icon.png

# Private working material: locked character descriptions, the children's
# heights, generation job IDs, reference-game measurements.
CHARACTER-BIBLE.md
CARD-ART.md
REFERENCE-GAME.md
SCENE-*.md

# Local tooling and build output
.claude/
dist/
.DS_Store

# Scene masters (2688x1520, ~8MB each). The game uses assets/scenes/web/.
assets/scenes/*.png
